import{_ as i,o,c as t,a2 as n}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 264 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Myriad-Races Exclusion: Benefiting Humanity Alone Is Civilizational Resource Monopoly","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 264 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Myriad-Races Exclusion: Benefiting Humanity Alone Is Civilizational Resource Monopoly","no":264,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Myriad-Races Exclusion","Civilizational Resource Monopoly","Human-Centered","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program","50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview","52-Foreign-Race Classification and Symbiosis"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0264_模块2-唐罗-万族排斥批判.md","filePath":"en/0264_模块2-唐罗-万族排斥批判.md"}'),a={name:"en/0264_模块2-唐罗-万族排斥批判.md"};function s(r,e,l,c,u,d){return o(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[n('<h1 id="entry-264-tang-luo-decomposition-critique-of-myriad-races-exclusion-benefiting-humanity-alone-is-civilizational-resource-monopoly" tabindex="-1">Entry 264 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Myriad-Races Exclusion: Benefiting Humanity Alone Is Civilizational Resource Monopoly <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-264-tang-luo-decomposition-critique-of-myriad-races-exclusion-benefiting-humanity-alone-is-civilizational-resource-monopoly" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 264 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Critique of Myriad-Races Exclusion: Benefiting Humanity Alone Is Civilizational Resource Monopoly&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 14)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-one-race-s-benefit-myriad-races-sorrow" tabindex="-1">Introduction: One race&#39;s benefit, Myriad Races&#39; sorrow <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-one-race-s-benefit-myriad-races-sorrow" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: One race&#39;s benefit, Myriad Races&#39; sorrow&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires all beings to have equal evolution qualification, with 99% full coverage. Tang Luo&#39;s universal-benefit radius stops at humanity&#39;s boundary, equivalent to declaring over 90% of the world&#39;s sentient beings are not within &quot;all beings.&quot; This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, arguing that &quot;benefiting humanity alone&quot; is essentially civilizational resource monopoly. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Myriad-Races exclusion causes &quot;ecological&quot; energy-level waste:</p><ul><li><strong>Other races&#39; talents idled</strong>: among strange beasts there are many with extraordinary talent; plant spirits, mountain-river wills, planet consciousness each have their unique perception and cultivation paths. These talents are obliterated by the &quot;non-human&quot; label, unable to convert into civilization energy</li><li><strong>Ecological conflict consumption</strong>: under the human-demon opposition norm, humanity spends massive resources on defense, expedition, and extermination. This consumption could have been used for joint frontier expansion — excluding Myriad Races is equivalent to spending a large part of civilization&#39;s budget on one&#39;s own neighbors</li><li><strong>Knowledge monocropping</strong>: human methods only iterate within humanity&#39;s physiological upper limit, losing the opportunity to collide with foreign-race methods. Civilization&#39;s knowledge ecosystem is artificially monocropped; monocropped ecosystems have extremely poor risk resistance</li></ul><p>Energy-level waste: <strong>expelling 90% of sentient beings from &quot;all beings&quot; is equivalent to cutting civilization&#39;s talent pool by 90%.</strong> This is the deepest energy-level waste — not wasting power, but wasting &quot;possibility.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Enemy externalization</strong>: excluded Myriad Races cannot participate in human civilization, can only exist in hostile mode. Civilization forever has external enemies, forever war-preparing, forever unable to fully develop</li><li><strong>Internal conservatism</strong>: humanity forms a superiority complex from &quot;exclusive enjoyment,&quot; any voice advocating opening Myriad Races is seen as betrayal. Civilization&#39;s thought boundaries close increasingly</li><li><strong>Sample exhaustion</strong>: without foreign-race reference, humanity does not know where its own methods have problems. A closed-door cultivation system will inevitably lag behind open-type civilizations after a hundred years</li></ol><p>Regression form: the more prosperous humanity is internally, the tenser the whole world&#39;s ecology. Ultimately either defeated externally, or trapped to death by internal conservatism.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Racial exclusive occupation is predation</strong>: defaulting the world&#39;s cultivation resources, knowledge, territory as humanity&#39;s property is equivalent to declaring Myriad Races &quot;resources&quot; or &quot;enemies.&quot; This is civilizational-level resource monopoly</li><li><strong>Othering is predation</strong>: non-human sentient life is deprived of qualification to enter moral circles. Tang Luo is extremely good to humanity, but this good does not extend beyond the racial boundary — the radius of good is the radius of predation</li><li><strong>Ecological predation</strong>: under human-demon opposition, humanity exterminates demon beasts, destroys spirit veins, pollutes ecology for cultivation resources. This predation is not Tang Luo personally doing, but systematic behavior under the &quot;humanity first&quot; jurisprudence</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, his predation radius abruptly stops at the racial boundary. He is not maliciously xenophobic, but never included Myriad Races in the definition of &quot;all beings.&quot; What he lacks is not good will toward Myriad Races, but the legislative courage to expand the definition of &quot;all beings&quot; from one race to Myriad Races.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Human-Centered</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Myriad-Races Republicanism</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Benefits only humanity</td><td>Myriad Races 99% full coverage, five genealogies (carbon-based matter / energy-coagulated / mechanical / consciousness-information / mixed-mutant) all equal</td></tr><tr><td>Strange beasts default-enemy</td><td>Strange beasts opening spirits, plant spirits, planet consciousness enjoy complete rights per Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</td></tr><tr><td>Human-demon opposition</td><td>Myriad Races republican co-building, cross-racial method adaptation, ecological reconciliation written into constitution</td></tr><tr><td>Resources humanity-first</td><td>Cultivation Resource Opening Mechanism: distributed by contribution, not by race</td></tr><tr><td>Othering moral circle</td><td>Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program: all beings are contracting parties</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: upgrade &quot;humanity&#39;s universal benefit&quot; to &quot;all beings&#39; universal benefit.&quot; Draw the circle one size larger; every good deed Tang Luo already did automatically doubles its benefit surface.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: replicate human-demon opposition&#39;s resource ratio and hostility coefficient</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A humanity-first; Group B injects the republican axiom of Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Observation</strong>: war frequency within a hundred years, human elite rate, Myriad Races overall energy</li><li><strong>Review expectation</strong>: Group B war frequency drops 70%, overall energy surpasses Group A — quantifying the &quot;racial exclusion tax&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. Human-demon opposition is its world-view底色, self-consistent</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Late if a &quot;powerful foreign-race ally&quot; is needed to fight new enemies, the early &quot;non-human is demon&quot; setting will be torn by plot; or to create climaxes, temporarily let some demon beast &quot;suddenly speak human, suddenly become cultivatable,&quot; racial boundaries stretch and shrink with plot</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high. Racial jurisprudence is backed only by Tang Luo; once he retires, human chauvinism automatically restores</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: 90% of sentient beings expelled from all beings, talent pool cut by 90%</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: one race exclusively possessing evolution rights = civilizational resource monopoly</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s good stops at humanity&#39;s boundary, exactly the old era&#39;s ceiling</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: this entry is a positive example of the Myriad Races full coverage axiom</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: racial boundaries not broken, cross-plane cooperation cannot be discussed</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Benefiting humanity alone, sounding like good policy, actually divides civilization&#39;s cake by race — humanity gets the big piece, Myriad Races get air. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment: race is not the unit of distribution, all beings are. If Tang Luo&#39;s universal benefit cannot cross the racial line, it is forever one race&#39;s welfare, not civilization&#39;s liberation.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · critique of Myriad-Races exclusion described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./05-万族共进基本纲领.html">05-Myriad Races Common Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./50-万族谱系总览.html">50-Myriad Races Genealogy Overview</a> · <a href="./52-异族分类与共生.html">52-Foreign-Race Classification and Symbiosis</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
